# Shared 47-participant / 8-EV behavioral-association template.
# Render only through code/run_crossed_behavior_l3.py; EV_* and paths are placeholders.
# EV order: sex, tSNR, mean FD, corrected mean RT, younger, older,
# younger x centered behavior, older x centered behavior. No redundant intercept.
